WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
Luke blocks Ryu’s OD Shoryuken.

2
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.450
Back heavy punch catches Ryu’s recovery as Punish Counter.

3
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:03.250
Crouching heavy punch links into the special cancel.

4
00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:04.350
Perfect medium Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

5
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.400
Perfect light Flash Knuckle continues the punish.

6
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.150
Heavy Flash Knuckle completes the punish.
